==Swedish==
{{wikipedia|lang=sv}}
===Alternative forms===
* [[Eric]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|sv}} {{term|Eiríkr|lang=non}}.

===Proper noun===
{{head|sv|proper noun}}

# {{given name|male|lang=sv}}.

====Usage notes====
* Traditionally one of the most popular names in [[Sweden]], said to have been borne by 14 kings (out of which 5 are now considered mythological).

